# AICL Example: Swap First Last
# AX sub-language — compiles to real code.

Goal:
Swap first and last element

Layer:
Core

Behavior Swap
    Input: array
    Output: array
    Action:
        n = len(array)
        if n < 2:
            return array
        temp = array[0]
        array[0] = array[n - 1]
        array[n - 1] = temp
        return array
